{"id":"0bef01f8f19e158b","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-onto-functional-php-resolution-size-lower.md","title":"Book PHP Resolution Size Bound","display":"thm-onto-functional-php-resolution-size-lower — Book PHP Resolution Size Bound","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-onto-functional-php-resolution-size-lower","aliases":["72-thm-onto-functional-php-resolution-size-lower"],"display":"thm-onto-functional-php-resolution-size-lower — Book PHP Resolution Size Bound","depends_on":["[[72-df-resolution-system]]","[[72-thm-php-resolution-lower]]"],"source_location":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, section 9.2 and Theorem 9.2.5; printed pp. 607, 611-612; PDF pp. 619, 623-624","source_statement_status":"source-statement-compared","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_proof_status":"Four CNF families and theorem proof end checked; random-restriction probability estimates not independently rederived","round2_verification_status":"source-statement-checked; proof-scope-limited"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-onto-functional-php-resolution-size-lower"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-onto-functional-php-resolution-size-lower</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-onto-functional-php-resolution-size-lower — Book PHP Resolution Size Bound"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e585861c4ee3b135\" href=\"?note=e585861c4ee3b135\" title=\"72-df-resolution-system\">72-df-resolution-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"53a60483631f158b\" href=\"?note=53a60483631f158b\" title=\"72-thm-php-resolution-lower\">72-thm-php-resolution-lower</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, section 9.2 and Theorem 9.2.5; printed pp. 607, 611-612; PDF pp. 619, 623-624"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"source-statement-compared"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"Four CNF families and theorem proof end checked; random-restriction probability estimates not independently rederived"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; proof-scope-limited"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq1\">\\(n\\geq1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\{1,\\ldots,n+1\\}\">\\(D=\\{1,\\ldots,n+1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(R=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_{i,j}\">\\(p_{i,j}\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in D,j\\in R\">\\(i\\in D,j\\in R\\)</span>）为两两不同的命题变量。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_{\\mathrm{Res}}\">\\(s_{\\mathrm{Res}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_{\\mathrm{Res}}\">\\(\\mu_{\\mathrm{Res}}\\)</span> 及固定编码如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e585861c4ee3b135\" href=\"?note=e585861c4ee3b135\" title=\"72-df-resolution-system\">72-df-resolution-system</a>；通常 PHP 子句集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PHP}^{n+1}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{PHP}^{n+1}_n\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"53a60483631f158b\" href=\"?note=53a60483631f158b\" title=\"72-thm-php-resolution-lower\">72-thm-php-resolution-lower</a>，这里只复用该节点的显式 CNF 定义，不使用其强下界的证明。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FPHP}^{n+1}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{FPHP}^{n+1}_n\\)</span> 是 Assertion 定义的 onto-functional 鸽巢子句集合。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FPHP}^{n+1}_n={}&amp;\n\\bigl\\{\\{p_{i,j}:j\\in R\\}:i\\in D\\bigr\\}\n\\cup\\bigl\\{\\{p_{i,j}:i\\in D\\}:j\\in R\\bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\bigl\\{\\{\\neg p_{i,j},\\neg p_{i,k}\\}:i\\in D,\\ j,k\\in R,\\ j&lt;k\\bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\bigl\\{\\{\\neg p_{i,j},\\neg p_{k,j}\\}:i,k\\in D,\\ i&lt;k,\\ j\\in R\\bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FPHP}^{n+1}_n={}&amp;\n\\bigl\\{\\{p_{i,j}:j\\in R\\}:i\\in D\\bigr\\}\n\\cup\\bigl\\{\\{p_{i,j}:i\\in D\\}:j\\in R\\bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\bigl\\{\\{\\neg p_{i,j},\\neg p_{i,k}\\}:i\\in D,\\ j,k\\in R,\\ j&lt;k\\bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\bigl\\{\\{\\neg p_{i,j},\\neg p_{k,j}\\}:i,k\\in D,\\ i&lt;k,\\ j\\in R\\bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\geq\\max(1,n_0)\\;\ns_{\\mathrm{Res}}(\\mathrm{FPHP}^{n+1}_n)\\geq2^{c n^{1/3}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists c\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\geq\\max(1,n_0)\\;\ns_{\\mathrm{Res}}(\\mathrm{FPHP}^{n+1}_n)\\geq2^{c n^{1/3}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PHP}^{n+1}_n\\subseteq\\mathrm{FPHP}^{n+1}_n,\\qquad\ns_{\\mathrm{Res}}(\\mathrm{PHP}^{n+1}_n)\\geq s_{\\mathrm{Res}}(\\mathrm{FPHP}^{n+1}_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PHP}^{n+1}_n\\subseteq\\mathrm{FPHP}^{n+1}_n,\\qquad\ns_{\\mathrm{Res}}(\\mathrm{PHP}^{n+1}_n)\\geq s_{\\mathrm{Res}}(\\mathrm{FPHP}^{n+1}_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>来源：Chapter VIII，§9.2 的四类子句（印刷页 607 / PDF 页 619）及 Theorem 9.2.5（印刷页 611–612 / PDF 页 623–624）。原书所写 PHP 的反驳输入编码一一且满的映射；此处用 FPHP 名称区分既有的普通 PHP CNF。</li>\n<li>已比较四类子句及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n^{1/3}\">\\(n^{1/3}\\)</span> 指数的来源陈述，阅读了印刷页 611–612 的定理证明结尾；随机限制引理的概率估计（印刷页 609–611）没有逐项独立复算，故不主张已完整复核该证明。</li>\n<li>最后一行是本地直接推导：从较小初始子句集合的任意反驳也是较大集合的反驳，因此增加公理不能增大最短反驳大小。这使书内下界也适用于普通 PHP 的编码大小。</li>\n<li>这个来源支持的较弱下界不替代既有的强 Haken 行数下界，不混同行数与编码大小。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-resolution-system","status":"resolved","id":"e585861c4ee3b135","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-resolution-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-php-resolution-lower","status":"resolved","id":"53a60483631f158b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-php-resolution-lower]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-resolution-system","status":"resolved","id":"e585861c4ee3b135","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s_{\\mathrm{Res}}$、$\\mu_{\\mathrm{Res}}$ 及固定编码如 [[72-df-resolution-system]]；通常 PHP 子句集合 $\\mathrm{PHP}^{n+1}_n$ 如 [[72-thm-php-resolution-lower]]，这里只复用该节点的显式 CNF 定义，不使用其强下界的证明。","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-php-resolution-lower","status":"resolved","id":"53a60483631f158b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s_{\\mathrm{Res}}$、$\\mu_{\\mathrm{Res}}$ 及固定编码如 [[72-df-resolution-system]]；通常 PHP 子句集合 $\\mathrm{PHP}^{n+1}_n$ 如 [[72-thm-php-resolution-lower]]，这里只复用该节点的显式 CNF 定义，不使用其强下界的证明。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"D=\\{1,\\ldots,n+1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"R=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"p_{i,j}","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in D,j\\in R","display":false},{"tex":"s_{\\mathrm{Res}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu_{\\mathrm{Res}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PHP}^{n+1}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FPHP}^{n+1}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FPHP}^{n+1}_n={}&\n\\bigl\\{\\{p_{i,j}:j\\in R\\}:i\\in D\\bigr\\}\n\\cup\\bigl\\{\\{p_{i,j}:i\\in D\\}:j\\in R\\bigr\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\bigl\\{\\{\\neg p_{i,j},\\neg p_{i,k}\\}:i\\in D,\\ j,k\\in R,\\ j<k\\bigr\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\bigl\\{\\{\\neg p_{i,j},\\neg p_{k,j}\\}:i,k\\in D,\\ i<k,\\ j\\in R\\bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\geq\\max(1,n_0)\\;\ns_{\\mathrm{Res}}(\\mathrm{FPHP}^{n+1}_n)\\geq2^{c n^{1/3}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PHP}^{n+1}_n\\subseteq\\mathrm{FPHP}^{n+1}_n,\\qquad\ns_{\\mathrm{Res}}(\\mathrm{PHP}^{n+1}_n)\\geq s_{\\mathrm{Res}}(\\mathrm{FPHP}^{n+1}_n).","display":true},{"tex":"n^{1/3}","display":false}],"bytes":2815,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-351","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-onto-functional-php-resolution-size-lower|thm-onto-functional-php-resolution-size-lower — Book PHP Resolution Size Bound]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-349","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[thm-onto-functional-php-resolution-size-lower — Book PHP Resolution Size Bound](72-thm-onto-functional-php-resolution-size-lower.md)"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-377","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-onto-functional-php-resolution-size-lower|thm-onto-functional-php-resolution-size-lower — Book PHP Resolution Size Bound]]"},{"id":"53a60483631f158b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"保留历史限制：Haken [1985] 原论文未取得全文；现在支撑数学结论的是上述作者一手后续证明，不再把书中较弱 $n^{1/3}$ 下界误作强下界的依据。书内的 onto+functional 变体另见 [[72-thm-onto-functional-php-resolution-size-lower]]。"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-513","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-onto-functional-php-resolution-size-lower]]"}],"outgoing":["e585861c4ee3b135","53a60483631f158b"]}